<title>HONG KONG: Cheung Kong holds nearly 50 pct of Hutch.</title>
<headline>Cheung Kong holds nearly 50 pct of Hutch.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cheung Kong (Holdings) Ltd's interest in Hutchison Whampoa Ltd is two million shares short of 50 percent, Li Ka-shing, chairman of both companies, told reporters on Thursday.</p>
<p>He did not elaborate.</p>
<p>Two million shares is equivalent to about 0.05 percent of Hutchison's total issued share capital of 3.873 billion shares, meaning Cheung Kong holds about 49.95 percent of Hutchison.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
